
=== MiniMCU Stage 01 : GPIO RW32 ===

Reset registers:
  INPUT=0x00000000 OUTPUT=0x00000000 DIR=0x00000000

DIR    <- 0x00000003   pins 0..1 become outputs
OUTPUT <- 0x00000001   pin0=1 pin1=0
SET    <- 0x00000002   pin1=1
CLEAR  <- 0x00000001   pin0=0
external input mask=0x0C value=0x04

Final:
  INPUT/PINS=0x00000006 OUTPUT=0x00000002 DIR=0x00000003

[DEMO DONE] stage 01
